  "description": "The engine of OpenCAD2D, a 2D CAD app that works like AutoCAD 2021, with no UI: DXF and DWG drawings opened as documents, drawn into 2D display lists, picked, and edited through AutoCAD's commands on a command line; AutoLISP and DCL, plot to PDF, command plugins and the Remote server. Its default fonts, hatch patterns, linetypes and template are copied beside the program that uses it.",
